# Udon programs MenSharp generates from the sources on every compile. Nothing
# references them (panels use the programs of their own subclasses), and a
# project that installs the package gets them regenerated, so they are not
# versioned (the base class alone is over 10 MB and changes with every edit).
/Runtime/Programs/
/Runtime/Programs.meta
/Samples~/Demos/Programs/
/Samples~/Demos/Programs.meta

